  "body": "Brings `.claude/agents/PR-reviewer.md` up to how reviews actually run today. Docs/process only.\n\n- **Sets the review label** (merge-ready / needs-rework / conflicts / needs-maintainer per review-prs step 2b) and removes the others; new step 7. Own PRs go back to draft on red or orange.\n- **Worktree under `.claude/worktrees/`** with its own `CARGO_TARGET_DIR`; cleanup removes the target.\n- **Per-PR locks** (`.claude/pr-review-<N>.lock`) honoured when the dispatcher names one; only your own lock is deleted.\n- **Foreground builds/tests with a timeout**: several reviews stalled waiting on dead background runs.\n\nMerged straight away on the maintainer's instruction.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
